sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Permission queue
  participant H as PermissionRequest Hook
  participant C as classifier
  participant U as user dialog
  participant O as resolveOnce
  P->>H: start
  P->>C: start / maybe await
  P->>U: render when needed
  C-->>O: candidate allow
  U-->>O: candidate deny
  H-->>O: candidate rewrite
  O-->>P: exactly one claimed decision
  Note over O: 后到候选被忽略，不重复执行
